{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、遅くなったけど\nみなみ誕生日おめ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーあ\n日付変わってしまったよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"充電器無くしてしまって\n電源つかなかった(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ママの充電器借りてるよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の帰り\nアイドルの歌声しか入ってない\n中田の大切な\n携帯型デジタル音楽プレーヤーさんを\n駅のホーム下に落下させてしまって\n駅員さんに取ってもらったよ(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"駅員さんが、天使に見えました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかこう、\nぼやけていて\nはっきりしなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう、その時\n中田は裸眼でした。\n視力0.1もないですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと前に\nコンタクトを目にいいものに変えた\nって書いたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相性悪いのかもしれないと思い始めた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コンタクトが\n目から出てきちゃう(´・ω・`)目からうろこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前のより\n酸素通しやすいのに進化させたんだが\n慣れるのに時間かかるのかな(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"災難続き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/02/07/8453645/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/02/07/8453645/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も１日がんばりましょ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}